                <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">Withhold</p>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;">
                <p style="text-align: justify;">To re-appoint the Company's auditor, De Visser Gray LLP, for the fiscal year ending June 2025 and to authorize the directors to fix their remuneration.</p>
            </td>
            <td style="width: 6%; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle;">
                <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&#9744;</p>
            </td>
